{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeDocument.vue",
    "title": "知识文章正文加载与引用导航组件",
    "summary": "KnowledgeDocument.vue 根据文档键和可选 revision 加载知识文章，呈现摘要、来源状态、目录、Markdown 正文与开放问题，并把可操作引用转换为上层 trail 导航帧。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "load-and-race",
        "title": "加载、版本与竞态处理",
        "body": "组件监听 documentKey 与 revision，并立即执行文章请求；文档键和 revision 都经过 URL 编码。每轮请求递增 generation，只有仍为最新的一轮可以写入 article、发出 loaded 或显示错误，从而避免快速切换文档时旧响应覆盖新页面。加载前清空旧文章；成功渲染后等待 DOM 更新，再按可选 section 使用 `CSS.escape` 定位并滚动到对应章节。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "rendering",
        "title": "正文结构与来源状态",
        "body": "请求期间显示读取状态，失败显示知识不可用空态。成功后依次展示标题、摘要、当前或历史知识徽标、模型来源说明；章节超过两个时才生成目录。每个 section 交给共享 `OmMarkdown` 渲染，并传入文章 citations；文末挂载 `KnowledgeQuestions`，使用当前文章 key 继续读取或处理开放问题。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "citation-navigation",
        "title": "引用导航与边界",
        "body": "Markdown 发出 citation key 后，`cite` 在当前文章 citations 中查找目标。只有 citation 标记为 actionable 且文章仍存在时才发出 navigate；导航帧 id 序列化 document、文章 revision 和 citation key，标题使用人读 label。[[c3]] 组件不自行读取原始证据，也不解释不可操作 reason，而把具体引用页面和 trail 栈管理交给父层。章节滚动使用选择器定位，目录点击也在当前根节点内滚动；本文件没有加载取消、重试按钮或空章节校验。[[c4]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "文章加载与 generation 防竞态",
        "reason": "支持参数编码、迟到响应抑制、加载后章节定位的完整流程。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeDocument.vue",
          "startLine": 6,
          "endLine": 19
        },
        "quote": "const props = defineProps<{ prefix: string; documentKey: string; revision?: string; section?: string }>();\nconst emit = defineEmits<{ navigate: [frame: KnowledgeFrame]; loaded: [title: string] }>();\nconst article = ref<Article | null>(null), error = ref(\"\");\nconst root = ref<HTMLElement>();\nlet generation = 0;\nwatch(()"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "知识正文与开放问题渲染",
        "reason": "支持加载状态、来源徽标、目录、Markdown 章节及问题组件的结构。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeDocument.vue",
          "startLine": 26,
          "endLine": 43
        },
        "quote": "<template>\n  <article ref=\"root\" class=\"knowledge-document\">\n    <OmEmpty v-if=\"error\" title=\"知识暂不可用\" :description=\"error\" />\n    <p v-else-if=\"!article\" class=\"muted\" role=\"status\">正在读取知识正文…</p>\n    <template v-else>\n      <h2>{{ article.title }}</h2>\n      <p class=\"knowledge-summary\">{{ article.summary }}</p>\n      "
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "可操作引用转导航帧",
        "reason": "支持引用查找、actionable 门槛和导航载荷所含字段。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeDocument.vue",
          "startLine": 20,
          "endLine": 24
        },
        "quote": "function cite(key: string) {\n  const c = article.value?.citations.find(c => c.key === key);\n  if (!c?.actionable || !article.value) return;\n  emit(\"navigate\", { kind: \"citation\", id: JSON.stringify({ document: props.documentKey, revision: article.value.revision, citation: key }), title: c.label });\n}"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "目录与章节滚动行为",
        "reason": "支持目录只在章节较多时出现，并在组件根节点内定位章节。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeDocument.vue",
          "startLine": 31,
          "endLine": 41
        },
        "quote": "      <h2>{{ article.title }}</h2>\n      <p class=\"knowledge-summary\">{{ article.summary }}</p>\n      <div class=\"knowledge-provenance\"><OmBadge>{{ article.current ? '当前知识' : '历史知识 · 来源已变化' }}</OmBadge><span>AI 分析并独立复核 · {{ article.model }}</span></div>\n      <nav v-if=\"article.document.sections.length > 2\" class=\"arti"
      }
    ],
    "questions": []
  },
